{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id135284756"}, "name":{"label":"teemmkayy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-29T06:14:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.12.0"}, "id":{"label":"13568987595"}, "title":{"label":"I wish I didn’t have to use this app"}, "content":{"label":"God bless anyone who has to use this application. Every time they update they lose some kind of function unintended. I know they mean well. But the outcome is never as intended. Currently, when you try to add photos to the chart, the app crashes. Which is a bummer because every patient needs multiple pictures added to their chart. When I say my nightly prayers, this development team hits the rotations. Please please make this better.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=460369272&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id22728289"}, "name":{"label":"GroovyBones"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-20T07:08:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.11.0"}, "id":{"label":"13420512866"}, "title":{"label":"Results are a disaster"}, "content":{"label":"Unified results are an unmitigated disaster. I can no longer save anything I sign in the results section. Terrible “upgrade. ”\nAs I write this, I am watching a never-ending “please wait” with a marching status bar. No problems with the internet, just another awful day with ModMed. \nThe worst EMR I have ever used. Don’t do it!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=460369272&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
