{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id201267724"}, "name":{"label":"Slimmy P"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-28T20:02:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"12118243718"}, "title":{"label":"Needs a LOT of Work"}, "content":{"label":"I really was hoping that I’d like the ModMed application and EMR system. But there’s so much to be desired and a ton of work the developers need to make this a premier EME system. Basic functions on the iPhone app like Narcotic prescriptions can’t be sent on your iPhone but are ok on the IPad. Creating an appointment. Creating more starting a progress note. \n\nThe iPad app itself has major flaws which I’ve brought to the attention of the developers as well but to no response or change. Wish they cared more about improving their own software. It’s a shame.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=460369272&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id11233330"}, "name":{"label":"ForkYa Fan Aaron"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-05T22:12:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"10907288320"}, "title":{"label":"So Bad"}, "content":{"label":"Literally this app is so bad. It is completely limited to the point of being worthless. I can’t edit anything, access imaging. What is the point of this? Either make it equivalent to the iPad version or just scrap the whole thing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=460369272&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id238493601"}, "name":{"label":"Smeckerton"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-02T12:25:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"10894112396"}, "title":{"label":"Constant bugs"}, "content":{"label":"Terrible terrible app. There seems to be no staff manning this app at all. The charting system itself has its fair share of errors and poor upkeep but the app is on a whole other level. You cannot even search a patient anymore without the app crashing when you try to enter 3-4 characters of a patient’s name, MR #, or DOB. The face recognition software is also garbage. Do yourself a favor and avoid this app at all costs.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=460369272&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1249580503"}, "name":{"label":"AnxiousSleeeper"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-16T18:07:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"10593350295"}, "title":{"label":"Incomplete"}, "content":{"label":"I feel like tasks have to be included in the app. Our practice uses those way more than intramail and I was hoping to be able to catch up on work on the go.\nAnother thing is inability to attach a document in Attachments. Photos is the last thing that should be offered. Instead it is the ONLY one. Make it make sense.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=460369272&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
