{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24927052"}, "name":{"label":"ezyduce"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-08-12T14:34:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"8972353802"}, "title":{"label":"Consistently buggy frustrating app that will bog down your mobile medical practice"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve had ModMed for about eight years and the app just keeps getting worse. You have to delete it and reinstall it all the time to even get functionality and Face ID almost never works. For the amount of money these guys get paid every month they should really hire some better IT professionals!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=460369272&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id323246772"}, "name":{"label":"Mhealth App Lover"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-22T09:01:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"8900689090"}, "title":{"label":"Simply Awful"}, "content":{"label":"EMA offers our practice a negative return form it’s cost. \n\nThe Mod Med EHR has no (zero) benefits regarding workflow, paperwork, outcomes, time savings, inter-operative communications with other practices, safety or costs. \n\nIn addition, I’m sure they monetize the PHI physicians pay to input along with patient skin photos. \n\nMy advice to anyone thinking about leasing this software is to avoid at all costs including Govt fines.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=460369272&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
